how to be creative  so i'm at the airport i just arrived and  i saw a question  while i was at tim hortons picking up my  ice cap  and uh it was a question from one of my  youtube viewers love you guys  michelle who wrote in to ask about what  do you do when you're stuck how do you  be creative when you're stuck how do you  get that idea  and i thought you know i gotta make this  quick video before we hire before i get  into the airport  uh creative you come from two things  okay it'll come from  exposure to new ideas and it'll come  from freedom  and i'll go over both quickly exposure  to new ideas if you're not getting any  creative  new ideas right now chances are your  life is boring your life is too boring  your routine is too boring your schedule  is too boring you're doing the same  thing  every day and it's boring and you're  probably not really happy right now  creativity comes from variety right you  got to expose yourself to new ideas for  new opportunities you gotta  do things that stretch your comfort zone  a little bit and from there  you'll get creative ideas now i'm at the  airport right now traveling  is a great place to get creative ideas  every time you travel  you get new creative ideas to bring back  into your business into your life  it opens your eyes it refreshes your  thinking and you know you may not be  able to afford to go traveling right now  so  you know that's fine but find other ways  to change up your schedule  to be able to go out and do things that  are different and new and fun and expose  yourself  to ideas and people that bring out a  different side in you  you know i get a ton of credit creative  ideas because i  am surrounded by people  who who bring out different sides of me  who expose me to new ideas  and i've created a schedule where i've  factored that in where i'm doing  different things all the time so today  i'm at the airport  uh you know on the weekend as an example  i went to two trade shows  okay i like going to trade shows uh just  to see what's going on what people are  up to the different businesses that are  there  the first one was an rv trade show where  people were selling  campers and trailers and uh and buses  and everything you need to go camping  and  my wife and i go camping a couple times  a year and i thought hey we should we  should check that out  maybe get a motorhome uh whatever just  to educate ourselves  so that was on the saturday then on the  sunday at the same building  in uh just next door was the sexapalooza  show  and so we went to that and uh  totally different crowd totally  different vibe and it's probably safe to  say that we were  one of the only couple if not the only  couple to go to both  shows on the same weekend right the you  think the audience going to a rv trailer  show is gonna be different  than the ones going to the sexapalooza  show but we were there both  and that you know being exposed to those  kinds of ideas and  and different uh different culture and  different  different subgroups makes you more  creative even if  even if you're not like i'm not a  hardcore camper i'm not a hardcore  uh you know uh well i'm not an anything  kind of s  m guy but anyway maybe that's too  detailed i'm a pretty normal  meat and potatoes guy there but getting  in the details on the  evan carmichael channel but it doesn't  matter because those  being around different people and  different ideas will make you more  creative so  your schedule is probably too boring  your life is probably too boring right  now and you got to break out and do  something different  okay so that's the first one new ideas  and experiences the second is freedom  you got to give yourself the time to go  out  and do all these things creativity can't  be forced  you know if you have a goal to say hey i  want to get better at piano i want to  get better with email  marketing the more you practice the more  you focus the better you're going to get  at it right the more i practice my  scales and piano the better i'm going to  get at it with creativity  it's almost the opposite right you can't  say i'm going to be creative right now  right you that's why brainstorming  meetings often don't work very well  because you're  forcing people to be creative on the  spot where creativity will often come  from  taking walks uh sitting on the toilet  being in the shower right that's where  you get all your creative ideas because  you have a little bit of time where your  brain has  freedom where so many people are so over  scheduled  over committed that you're so worried  and stressed out about what you have to  do  that you have zero time to focus on  things that could help you grow new  creative ideas  so you have to open up chunks of your  time you have to be willing to go out  and  and and shower more go for walks  give yourself more time stop scheduling  so much stuff in there  okay that's how you get creative ideas  if you do those two things if you  consistently expose yourself  to people and ideas that are different  from you and you give yourself the  freedom to be able to explore  i guarantee you you're gonna come up  with a ton of creative ideas  and then your next question is going to  be how do i execute  but we'll worry about that when we get  there anyway i'm going to get in  thank you guys for watching believe you  guys like this video you want to see  more like it  subscribe to the channel uh i want to  know how you get  creative i want to know where your best  creative ideas come from leave a comment  below i'd love to hear from you  thank you guys i'll see you soon  evan your newsletters have taught me not  to quit  i look forward to them every week they  have changed my life  thank you  you

